IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg9-x-winding-up`
IMPORT `dg9-xii-revival`

-- Tests of dg9-xii-revival.l4 (8 Del. C. sections 311 to 314).
-- Every expected value is written by hand from the text, beside the assertion, before the run.
-- The wrappers `t ...` only give a rule's inputs short positional names; they restate no rule.

§ `Test wrappers`

GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN
      b IS A BOOLEAN
      c IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A BOOLEAN
      e IS A BOOLEAN
      f IS A BOOLEAN
      g IS A BOOLEAN
      h IS A BOOLEAN
      i IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 311(a)(4) Certificate of revocation of dissolution or of restoration`
`t 311(a)(4) certificate` a b c d e f g h i MEANS
    `s 311(a)(4) Certificate of revocation of dissolution or of restoration` WITH `designation in its heading as a certificate of revocation of dissolution or a certificate of restoration` IS a, `statement of the name of the corporation` IS b, `statement of the address of the registered office in this State, stated in accordance with § 131(c), and the name of the registered agent at that address` IS c, `statement of the names and respective addresses of the officers` IS d, `statement of the names and respective addresses of the directors` IS e, `statement of the date of filing of the original certificate of incorporation` IS f, `statement of the date of filing of the certificate of dissolution` IS g, `statement of the vote in favor of the resolution, or of the written consent in lieu of a meeting and vote` IS h, `statement of the new specified date limiting the duration of the existence of the corporation, or that the corporation shall have perpetual existence` IS i

GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN
      b IS A BOOLEAN
      c IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A BOOLEAN
      e IS A BOOLEAN
      f IS A BOOLEAN
      g IS A BOOLEAN
      h IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 312(d) Certificate of revival`
`t 312(d) certificate` a b c d e f g h MEANS
    `s 312(d) Certificate of revival` WITH `statement of the date of filing of the original certificate of incorporation` IS a, `statement of the name under which the corporation was originally incorporated` IS b, `statement of the name of the corporation at the time its certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void` IS c, `statement of the new name under which the corporation is to be revived` IS d, `statement of the address of the registered office in this State, stated in accordance with § 131(c), and the name of the registered agent at that address` IS e, `statement that the corporation desiring to be revived was organized under the laws of this State` IS f, `statement of the date when the certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void pursuant to this title, or that the validity of any revival has been brought into question` IS g, `statement that the certificate is filed by authority of the board of directors or members of the governing body in accordance with subsection (h)` IS h

GIVEN event IS A `s 311(a) Event ended by the certificate`
      board IS A BOOLEAN
      notice IS A BOOLEAN
      votes IS A NUMBER
      base IS A NUMBER
      consent IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`t 311(a) authorization` event board notice votes base consent MEANS
    `s 311(a) the revocation of the dissolution or the restoration of the certificate is authorized` WITH `the event` IS event, `the board of directors adopted a resolution recommending the revocation or restoration and directing that the question be submitted to a vote at a special meeting of stockholders` IS board, `notice of the special meeting was given to each of the stockholders in accordance with § 222` IS notice, `the votes voted for the resolution` IS votes, `the votes of the stock outstanding and entitled to vote at the time of the dissolution or the expiration` IS base, `the stockholders have given their written consent in lieu of a meeting and vote, in accordance with § 228` IS consent

§ `s 311 Revocation of voluntary dissolution; restoration of expired certificate of incorporation`

§§ `s 311(a) the time, the vote and the certificate`

-- Dissolved on 10 March 2026: 3 years run to 10 March 2029, the last day on which the certificate may be filed.
#ASSERT `s 311(a) the revocation of the dissolution or the restoration is within the time allowed` WITH `the date the dissolution became effective, or the time limited for the corporation’s existence expired` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 10, `the date to which the Court of Chancery has directed the corporation to be continued under section 278, if it has` IS NOTHING, `the date the certificate of revocation of dissolution or of restoration is filed` IS YearMonthDay 2029 3 10
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(a) the revocation of the dissolution or the restoration is within the time allowed` WITH `the date the dissolution became effective, or the time limited for the corporation’s existence expired` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 10, `the date to which the Court of Chancery has directed the corporation to be continued under section 278, if it has` IS NOTHING, `the date the certificate of revocation of dissolution or of restoration is filed` IS YearMonthDay 2029 3 11)
-- A longer period the Court of Chancery directed under section 278 (to 1 January 2031).
#ASSERT `s 311(a) the revocation of the dissolution or the restoration is within the time allowed` WITH `the date the dissolution became effective, or the time limited for the corporation’s existence expired` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 10, `the date to which the Court of Chancery has directed the corporation to be continued under section 278, if it has` IS JUST (YearMonthDay 2031 1 1), `the date the certificate of revocation of dissolution or of restoration is filed` IS YearMonthDay 2030 6 1
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(a) the revocation of the dissolution or the restoration is within the time allowed` WITH `the date the dissolution became effective, or the time limited for the corporation’s existence expired` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 10, `the date to which the Court of Chancery has directed the corporation to be continued under section 278, if it has` IS JUST (YearMonthDay 2031 1 1), `the date the certificate of revocation of dissolution or of restoration is filed` IS YearMonthDay 2031 1 2)
-- (a)(1): the stockholders are those of record on the date the dissolution became effective or the date of expiration.
#ASSERT `s 311(a)(1) the person is one of the stockholders for the purposes of section 311` WITH `the person was a stockholder of record on the date the dissolution became effective or on the date of expiration by limitation` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(a)(1) the person is one of the stockholders for the purposes of section 311` WITH `the person was a stockholder of record on the date the dissolution became effective or on the date of expiration by limitation` IS FALSE)
-- (a)(4): a majority of the stock outstanding and entitled to vote at the earlier time; the base differs by event.
#ASSERT (`s 311(a)(4) the vote that revokes the dissolution or restores the certificate` WITH `the event` IS `a dissolution pursuant to section 275`)'s `counted against` EQUALS `another base named in the provision` "the stock of the corporation which was outstanding and entitled to vote upon a dissolution at the time of its dissolution"
#ASSERT (`s 311(a)(4) the vote that revokes the dissolution or restores the certificate` WITH `the event` IS `an expiration of the time limited for the corporation’s existence`)'s `counted against` EQUALS `another base named in the provision` "the stock of the corporation which was outstanding and entitled to vote upon an amendment to the certificate of incorporation to change the period of the corporation’s duration at the time of its expiration by limitation"
#ASSERT (`s 311(a)(4) the vote that revokes the dissolution or restores the certificate` WITH `the event` IS `a dissolution pursuant to section 275`)'s `must be exceeded`
#ASSERT (`s 311(a)(4) the vote that revokes the dissolution or restores the certificate` WITH `the event` IS `a dissolution pursuant to section 275`)'s proportion EQUALS 1 DIVIDED BY 2
-- Authorization by the board's resolution, notice and a majority: 51 of 100 carries, 50 of 100 does not.
--  columns: event, board resolution, notice under section 222, votes for, votes outstanding then, written consent under section 228
#ASSERT (`t 311(a) authorization` `a dissolution pursuant to section 275` TRUE TRUE 51 100 FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`t 311(a) authorization` `a dissolution pursuant to section 275` TRUE TRUE 50 100 FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`t 311(a) authorization` `an expiration of the time limited for the corporation’s existence` TRUE TRUE 51 100 FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- No notice to each of the stockholders: not authorized.
#ASSERT (`t 311(a) authorization` `a dissolution pursuant to section 275` TRUE FALSE 51 100 FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- No board resolution: not authorized, whatever the vote or consent.
#ASSERT (`t 311(a) authorization` `a dissolution pursuant to section 275` FALSE TRUE 100 100 FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`t 311(a) authorization` `a dissolution pursuant to section 275` FALSE TRUE 100 100 TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Written consent under section 228 in lieu of a meeting and vote.
#ASSERT (`t 311(a) authorization` `a dissolution pursuant to section 275` TRUE FALSE 0 0 TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not covered: more votes than the stock then outstanding.
#ASSERT (`t 311(a) authorization` `a dissolution pursuant to section 275` TRUE TRUE 101 100 FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- The certificate: designated in its heading, the eight statements, executed and filed under section 103; (h) is for a restoration only.
--  columns: heading, name, registered office and agent, officers, directors, date of original certificate, date of certificate of dissolution, vote or consent, new date or perpetual existence
#ASSERT `s 311(a)(4) the certificate of revocation of dissolution or of restoration is in order` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 311(a)(4) certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE), `the event` IS `a dissolution pursuant to section 275`, `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(a)(4) the certificate of revocation of dissolution or of restoration is in order` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 311(a)(4) certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE), `the event` IS `an expiration of the time limited for the corporation’s existence`, `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 311(a)(4) the certificate of revocation of dissolution or of restoration is in order` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 311(a)(4) certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE), `the event` IS `an expiration of the time limited for the corporation’s existence`, `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(a)(4) the certificate of revocation of dissolution or of restoration is in order` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 311(a)(4) certificate` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE), `the event` IS `a dissolution pursuant to section 275`, `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(a)(4) the certificate of revocation of dissolution or of restoration is in order` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 311(a)(4) certificate` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE), `the event` IS `a dissolution pursuant to section 275`, `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(a)(4) the certificate of revocation of dissolution or of restoration is in order` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 311(a)(4) certificate` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE), `the event` IS `a dissolution pursuant to section 275`, `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(a)(4) the certificate of revocation of dissolution or of restoration is in order` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 311(a)(4) certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE), `the event` IS `a dissolution pursuant to section 275`, `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(a)(4) the certificate of revocation of dissolution or of restoration is in order` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 311(a)(4) certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE), `the event` IS `a dissolution pursuant to section 275`, `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(a)(4) the certificate of revocation of dissolution or of restoration is in order` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 311(a)(4) certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE), `the event` IS `a dissolution pursuant to section 275`, `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(a)(4) the certificate of revocation of dissolution or of restoration is in order` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 311(a)(4) certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE), `the event` IS `a dissolution pursuant to section 275`, `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(a)(4) the certificate of revocation of dissolution or of restoration is in order` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 311(a)(4) certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE), `the event` IS `a dissolution pursuant to section 275`, `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(a)(4) the certificate of revocation of dissolution or of restoration is in order` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 311(a)(4) certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE), `the event` IS `a dissolution pursuant to section 275`, `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103` IS FALSE)

§§ `s 311(b) to (g) effect, name, nonstock corporations, franchise taxes`

#ASSERT `s 311(b) the revocation of the dissolution or the restoration is effective and the corporation may again carry on its business` WITH `the certificate has become effective in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(b) the revocation of the dissolution or the restoration is effective and the corporation may again carry on its business` WITH `the certificate has become effective in accordance with § 103` IS FALSE)
-- (c): the period in dissolution counts toward the section 211(c) periods once effective; the special meeting at which directors are elected is deemed an annual meeting.
#ASSERT `s 311(c) the period the corporation was in dissolution or expired is included within the calculation of the periods to which section 211(c) refers` WITH `the revocation of the dissolution or the restoration is effective` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(c) the period the corporation was in dissolution or expired is included within the calculation of the periods to which section 211(c) refers` WITH `the revocation of the dissolution or the restoration is effective` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 311(c) the special meeting of stockholders is deemed an annual meeting of stockholders for the purposes of section 211(c)` WITH `the revocation of the dissolution or the restoration is effective` IS TRUE, `an election of directors is held at the special meeting of stockholders to which subsection (a) refers` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(c) the special meeting of stockholders is deemed an annual meeting of stockholders for the purposes of section 211(c)` WITH `the revocation of the dissolution or the restoration is effective` IS TRUE, `an election of directors is held at the special meeting of stockholders to which subsection (a) refers` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(c) the special meeting of stockholders is deemed an annual meeting of stockholders for the purposes of section 211(c)` WITH `the revocation of the dissolution or the restoration is effective` IS FALSE, `an election of directors is held at the special meeting of stockholders to which subsection (a) refers` IS TRUE)
-- (d): another Delaware corporation, or a foreign corporation qualified here, took the name since: the corporation must come back under another name.
#ASSERT `s 311(d) the corporation must be reinstated or restored under another name` WITH `since the dissolution became effective or the expiration, another corporation organized under the laws of this State has adopted the same name as the corporation, or a name so nearly similar as not to distinguish it from the corporation` IS TRUE, `since the dissolution became effective or the expiration, a foreign corporation has qualified to do business in this State under the same name as the corporation, or under a name so nearly similar as not to distinguish it from the corporation` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 311(d) the corporation must be reinstated or restored under another name` WITH `since the dissolution became effective or the expiration, another corporation organized under the laws of this State has adopted the same name as the corporation, or a name so nearly similar as not to distinguish it from the corporation` IS FALSE, `since the dissolution became effective or the expiration, a foreign corporation has qualified to do business in this State under the same name as the corporation, or under a name so nearly similar as not to distinguish it from the corporation` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(d) the corporation must be reinstated or restored under another name` WITH `since the dissolution became effective or the expiration, another corporation organized under the laws of this State has adopted the same name as the corporation, or a name so nearly similar as not to distinguish it from the corporation` IS FALSE, `since the dissolution became effective or the expiration, a foreign corporation has qualified to do business in this State under the same name as the corporation, or under a name so nearly similar as not to distinguish it from the corporation` IS FALSE)
-- The certificate then sets forth the old name and the new name; if the name is not changed, neither is needed.
#ASSERT `s 311(d) the certificate sets forth the names the subsection requires` WITH `the corporation must be reinstated or restored under another name` IS TRUE, `the certificate sets forth the name borne by the corporation at the time its dissolution became effective or it expired by limitation` IS TRUE, `the certificate sets forth the new name under which the corporation is to be reinstated or restored` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(d) the certificate sets forth the names the subsection requires` WITH `the corporation must be reinstated or restored under another name` IS TRUE, `the certificate sets forth the name borne by the corporation at the time its dissolution became effective or it expired by limitation` IS FALSE, `the certificate sets forth the new name under which the corporation is to be reinstated or restored` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(d) the certificate sets forth the names the subsection requires` WITH `the corporation must be reinstated or restored under another name` IS TRUE, `the certificate sets forth the name borne by the corporation at the time its dissolution became effective or it expired by limitation` IS TRUE, `the certificate sets forth the new name under which the corporation is to be reinstated or restored` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 311(d) the certificate sets forth the names the subsection requires` WITH `the corporation must be reinstated or restored under another name` IS FALSE, `the certificate sets forth the name borne by the corporation at the time its dissolution became effective or it expired by limitation` IS FALSE, `the certificate sets forth the new name under which the corporation is to be reinstated or restored` IS FALSE
-- (e): nothing here affects the Court's jurisdiction under sections 279 and 280.
#ASSERT `s 311(e) the Court of Chancery has jurisdiction or power under section 279 or section 280 after the revocation or restoration` WITH `the Court of Chancery has jurisdiction or power under section 279 or section 280` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(e) the Court of Chancery has jurisdiction or power under section 279 or section 280 after the revocation or restoration` WITH `the Court of Chancery has jurisdiction or power under section 279 or section 280` IS FALSE)
-- (f): for a nonstock corporation only (b), (d), (e) of section 311 apply (and (f) itself); a stock corporation is outside (f).
#ASSERT `s 311(f) the subsection of section 311 applies to the corporation` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`, `the subsection` IS `subsection (a) of section 311`
#ASSERT `s 311(f) the subsection of section 311 applies to the corporation` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`, `the subsection` IS `subsection (c) of section 311`
#ASSERT `s 311(f) the subsection of section 311 applies to the corporation` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`, `the subsection` IS `subsection (g) of section 311`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(f) the subsection of section 311 applies to the corporation` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`, `the subsection` IS `subsection (f) of section 311`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(f) the subsection of section 311 applies to the corporation` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a nonstock corporation with membership interests`, `the subsection` IS `subsection (a) of section 311`)
#ASSERT `s 311(f) the subsection of section 311 applies to the corporation` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a nonstock corporation with membership interests`, `the subsection` IS `subsection (b) of section 311`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(f) the subsection of section 311 applies to the corporation` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a charitable nonstock corporation`, `the subsection` IS `subsection (c) of section 311`)
#ASSERT `s 311(f) the subsection of section 311 applies to the corporation` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a charitable nonstock corporation`, `the subsection` IS `subsection (d) of section 311`
#ASSERT `s 311(f) the subsection of section 311 applies to the corporation` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable`, `the subsection` IS `subsection (e) of section 311`
#ASSERT `s 311(f) the subsection of section 311 applies to the corporation` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable`, `the subsection` IS `subsection (f) of section 311`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(f) the subsection of section 311 applies to the corporation` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable`, `the subsection` IS `subsection (g) of section 311`)
-- The nonstock corporation's own manner: a vote of the members entitled to vote, if any, and a comparable certificate.
#ASSERT `s 311(f) the nonstock corporation’s revocation or restoration is authorized and certified as the subsection requires` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 311(a)(4) certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE), `the event` IS `a dissolution pursuant to section 275`, `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE, `a vote of the members entitled to vote, if any, on the dissolution or the amendment was taken, if applicable` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(f) the nonstock corporation’s revocation or restoration is authorized and certified as the subsection requires` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 311(a)(4) certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE), `the event` IS `a dissolution pursuant to section 275`, `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE, `a vote of the members entitled to vote, if any, on the dissolution or the amendment was taken, if applicable` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 311(f) the nonstock corporation’s revocation or restoration is authorized and certified as the subsection requires` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 311(a)(4) certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE), `the event` IS `a dissolution pursuant to section 275`, `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103` IS FALSE, `a vote of the members entitled to vote, if any, on the dissolution or the amendment was taken, if applicable` IS TRUE)
-- (g): the franchise taxes the corporation would have paid; the payment does not reduce the tax due for the year.
#ASSERT (`s 311(g) the franchise taxes the corporation must pay on revoking its dissolution or restoring its certificate` WITH `the franchise taxes the corporation would have had to pay if it had not dissolved or expired` IS 4000) EQUALS 4000
#ASSERT (`s 311(g) the franchise tax still due under Chapter 5 for the year in which the revocation or restoration is effected` WITH `the franchise tax due under Chapter 5 for the year in which the revocation or restoration is effected` IS 1000, `the payment made pursuant to subsection (g)` IS 500) EQUALS 1000

§ `s 312 Revival of certificate of incorporation`

-- (a): the charter of a corporation organized under a special act or any law of this State is a certificate of incorporation here.
#ASSERT `s 312(a) the instrument is a certificate of incorporation for the purposes of section 312` WITH `the instrument is a certificate of incorporation` IS TRUE, `the instrument is the charter of a corporation organized under any special act or any law of this State` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 312(a) the instrument is a certificate of incorporation for the purposes of section 312` WITH `the instrument is a certificate of incorporation` IS FALSE, `the instrument is the charter of a corporation organized under any special act or any law of this State` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(a) the instrument is a certificate of incorporation for the purposes of section 312` WITH `the instrument is a certificate of incorporation` IS FALSE, `the instrument is the charter of a corporation organized under any special act or any law of this State` IS FALSE)
-- (b): a certificate forfeited or void may be revived, unless it was revoked or forfeited under section 284.
#ASSERT `s 312(b) the corporation may procure a revival of its certificate of incorporation` WITH `the certificate of incorporation has become forfeited or void pursuant to this title` IS TRUE, `the certificate of incorporation has been revoked or forfeited pursuant to § 284` IS FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(b) the corporation may procure a revival of its certificate of incorporation` WITH `the certificate of incorporation has become forfeited or void pursuant to this title` IS TRUE, `the certificate of incorporation has been revoked or forfeited pursuant to § 284` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(b) the corporation may procure a revival of its certificate of incorporation` WITH `the certificate of incorporation has become forfeited or void pursuant to this title` IS FALSE, `the certificate of incorporation has been revoked or forfeited pursuant to § 284` IS FALSE)
-- (c): authorized by the board under (h) and the certificate filed under section 103.
#ASSERT `s 312(c) the revival is procured` WITH `the board of directors or members of the governing body authorized the revival in accordance with subsection (h)` IS TRUE, `the certificate of revival was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(c) the revival is procured` WITH `the board of directors or members of the governing body authorized the revival in accordance with subsection (h)` IS FALSE, `the certificate of revival was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(c) the revival is procured` WITH `the board of directors or members of the governing body authorized the revival in accordance with subsection (h)` IS TRUE, `the certificate of revival was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103` IS FALSE)
-- (d): the five items of the certificate; the new name only where subsection (f) requires one.
--  columns: date of original certificate, original name, name when forfeited, new name, registered office and agent, organized under the laws of this State, date forfeited or validity questioned, authority of the board
#ASSERT `s 312(d) the certificate of revival states what the subsection requires` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 312(d) certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE), `subsection (f) requires the corporation to be revived under a new name` IS FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(d) the certificate of revival states what the subsection requires` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 312(d) certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE), `subsection (f) requires the corporation to be revived under a new name` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 312(d) the certificate of revival states what the subsection requires` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 312(d) certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE), `subsection (f) requires the corporation to be revived under a new name` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(d) the certificate of revival states what the subsection requires` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 312(d) certificate` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE), `subsection (f) requires the corporation to be revived under a new name` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(d) the certificate of revival states what the subsection requires` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 312(d) certificate` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE), `subsection (f) requires the corporation to be revived under a new name` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(d) the certificate of revival states what the subsection requires` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 312(d) certificate` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE), `subsection (f) requires the corporation to be revived under a new name` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(d) the certificate of revival states what the subsection requires` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 312(d) certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE), `subsection (f) requires the corporation to be revived under a new name` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(d) the certificate of revival states what the subsection requires` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 312(d) certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE), `subsection (f) requires the corporation to be revived under a new name` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(d) the certificate of revival states what the subsection requires` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 312(d) certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE), `subsection (f) requires the corporation to be revived under a new name` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(d) the certificate of revival states what the subsection requires` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 312(d) certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE), `subsection (f) requires the corporation to be revived under a new name` IS FALSE)
-- (e): revival, validation, property and liability.
#ASSERT `s 312(e) the corporation is revived with the same force and effect as if its certificate had not been forfeited or void` WITH `the certificate of revival was filed in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(e) the corporation is revived with the same force and effect as if its certificate had not been forfeited or void` WITH `the certificate of revival was filed in accordance with § 103` IS FALSE)
-- Acts within the scope of the certificate, during the forfeiture, by the corporation, a director, an officer, an agent or a stockholder, are validated.
#ASSERT (`s 312(e) the revival validates the contract, act, matter or thing` WITH `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS TRUE, `the person` IS `a director or member of the governing body of the corporation`, `it was made, done or performed within the scope of the certificate of incorporation` IS TRUE, `it was made, done or performed during the time when the certificate of incorporation was forfeited or void` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 312(e) the revival validates the contract, act, matter or thing` WITH `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS TRUE, `the person` IS `the corporation itself`, `it was made, done or performed within the scope of the certificate of incorporation` IS TRUE, `it was made, done or performed during the time when the certificate of incorporation was forfeited or void` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 312(e) the revival validates the contract, act, matter or thing` WITH `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS TRUE, `the person` IS `an officer of the corporation`, `it was made, done or performed within the scope of the certificate of incorporation` IS TRUE, `it was made, done or performed during the time when the certificate of incorporation was forfeited or void` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 312(e) the revival validates the contract, act, matter or thing` WITH `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS TRUE, `the person` IS `an agent of the corporation`, `it was made, done or performed within the scope of the certificate of incorporation` IS TRUE, `it was made, done or performed during the time when the certificate of incorporation was forfeited or void` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 312(e) the revival validates the contract, act, matter or thing` WITH `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS TRUE, `the person` IS `a stockholder or member of the corporation`, `it was made, done or performed within the scope of the certificate of incorporation` IS TRUE, `it was made, done or performed during the time when the certificate of incorporation was forfeited or void` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Outside the scope of the certificate, by a stranger, outside the forfeiture, or without a revival: the text validates nothing, so not covered.
#ASSERT (`s 312(e) the revival validates the contract, act, matter or thing` WITH `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS TRUE, `the person` IS `a director or member of the governing body of the corporation`, `it was made, done or performed within the scope of the certificate of incorporation` IS FALSE, `it was made, done or performed during the time when the certificate of incorporation was forfeited or void` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 312(e) the revival validates the contract, act, matter or thing` WITH `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS TRUE, `the person` IS `someone else`, `it was made, done or performed within the scope of the certificate of incorporation` IS TRUE, `it was made, done or performed during the time when the certificate of incorporation was forfeited or void` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 312(e) the revival validates the contract, act, matter or thing` WITH `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS TRUE, `the person` IS `an officer of the corporation`, `it was made, done or performed within the scope of the certificate of incorporation` IS TRUE, `it was made, done or performed during the time when the certificate of incorporation was forfeited or void` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 312(e) the revival validates the contract, act, matter or thing` WITH `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS FALSE, `the person` IS `an officer of the corporation`, `it was made, done or performed within the scope of the certificate of incorporation` IS TRUE, `it was made, done or performed during the time when the certificate of incorporation was forfeited or void` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Property: what belonged to the corporation and was not disposed of, and what it acquired after the forfeiture, is vested after revival.
#ASSERT `s 312(e) the property, right or credit is vested in the corporation after its revival` WITH `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS TRUE, `the property, right or credit belonged to the corporation when its certificate became forfeited or void and was not disposed of before the revival` IS TRUE, `the property, right or credit was acquired by the corporation after its certificate became forfeited or void` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 312(e) the property, right or credit is vested in the corporation after its revival` WITH `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS TRUE, `the property, right or credit belonged to the corporation when its certificate became forfeited or void and was not disposed of before the revival` IS FALSE, `the property, right or credit was acquired by the corporation after its certificate became forfeited or void` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(e) the property, right or credit is vested in the corporation after its revival` WITH `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS TRUE, `the property, right or credit belonged to the corporation when its certificate became forfeited or void and was not disposed of before the revival` IS FALSE, `the property, right or credit was acquired by the corporation after its certificate became forfeited or void` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(e) the property, right or credit is vested in the corporation after its revival` WITH `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS FALSE, `the property, right or credit belonged to the corporation when its certificate became forfeited or void and was not disposed of before the revival` IS TRUE, `the property, right or credit was acquired by the corporation after its certificate became forfeited or void` IS FALSE)
-- Liability: the revived corporation is as exclusively liable for what its directors, officers, agents and stockholders did in its name and on its behalf before the revival.
#ASSERT (`s 312(e) the corporation is as exclusively liable for the contract, act, matter or thing as if its certificate had at all times remained in force` WITH `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS TRUE, `the person` IS `a director or member of the governing body of the corporation`, `it was made, done or performed in the name and on behalf of the corporation prior to its revival` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 312(e) the corporation is as exclusively liable for the contract, act, matter or thing as if its certificate had at all times remained in force` WITH `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS TRUE, `the person` IS `a stockholder or member of the corporation`, `it was made, done or performed in the name and on behalf of the corporation prior to its revival` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 312(e) the corporation is as exclusively liable for the contract, act, matter or thing as if its certificate had at all times remained in force` WITH `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS TRUE, `the person` IS `someone else`, `it was made, done or performed in the name and on behalf of the corporation prior to its revival` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 312(e) the corporation is as exclusively liable for the contract, act, matter or thing as if its certificate had at all times remained in force` WITH `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS TRUE, `the person` IS `an officer of the corporation`, `it was made, done or performed in the name and on behalf of the corporation prior to its revival` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 312(e) the corporation is as exclusively liable for the contract, act, matter or thing as if its certificate had at all times remained in force` WITH `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS FALSE, `the person` IS `an officer of the corporation`, `it was made, done or performed in the name and on behalf of the corporation prior to its revival` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (f): the name was taken since the forfeiture by a Delaware corporation or a qualified foreign corporation.
#ASSERT `s 312(f) the corporation to be revived must be revived under some other name` WITH `since the certificate became forfeited or void, another corporation organized under the laws of this State has adopted the same name as the corporation to be revived, or a name so nearly similar as not to distinguish it` IS TRUE, `since the certificate became forfeited or void, a foreign corporation qualified in accordance with § 371 has adopted the same name as the corporation to be revived, or a name so nearly similar as not to distinguish it` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 312(f) the corporation to be revived must be revived under some other name` WITH `since the certificate became forfeited or void, another corporation organized under the laws of this State has adopted the same name as the corporation to be revived, or a name so nearly similar as not to distinguish it` IS FALSE, `since the certificate became forfeited or void, a foreign corporation qualified in accordance with § 371 has adopted the same name as the corporation to be revived, or a name so nearly similar as not to distinguish it` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(f) the corporation to be revived must be revived under some other name` WITH `since the certificate became forfeited or void, another corporation organized under the laws of this State has adopted the same name as the corporation to be revived, or a name so nearly similar as not to distinguish it` IS FALSE, `since the certificate became forfeited or void, a foreign corporation qualified in accordance with § 371 has adopted the same name as the corporation to be revived, or a name so nearly similar as not to distinguish it` IS FALSE)
-- (g): 5 years, and 3 times the annual franchise tax in lieu.
#ASSERT (`s 312(g) the time after which a forfeited or void certificate costs 3 times the annual franchise tax to revive`)'s `how many units` EQUALS 5
#ASSERT `s 312(g) the multiple of the annual franchise tax paid in lieu` EQUALS 3
-- Forfeited on 15 January 2020; revival on the 5th anniversary (15 January 2025) is not "more than 5 years": the taxes, penalties and interest due at the time (12000).
#ASSERT (`s 312(g) the sum the corporation pays to this State on revival` WITH `the franchise taxes, penalties and interest due at the time the certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void` IS 12000, `the annual franchise tax that would be due and payable for the year in which the revival is effected, at the then current rate of taxation` IS 2500, `the date the certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void` IS YearMonthDay 2020 1 15, `the date the revival is effected` IS YearMonthDay 2025 1 15) EQUALS 12000
-- One day later it is more than 5 years: 3 times the annual franchise tax (2500), so 7500.
#ASSERT (`s 312(g) the sum the corporation pays to this State on revival` WITH `the franchise taxes, penalties and interest due at the time the certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void` IS 12000, `the annual franchise tax that would be due and payable for the year in which the revival is effected, at the then current rate of taxation` IS 2500, `the date the certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void` IS YearMonthDay 2020 1 15, `the date the revival is effected` IS YearMonthDay 2025 1 16) EQUALS 7500
-- Forfeited on 29 February 2020: 5 years later clamps to 28 February 2025 (the core's reading, fork F2 of the core), so 28 February 2025 is not more than 5 years and 1 March 2025 is.
#ASSERT (`s 312(g) the sum the corporation pays to this State on revival` WITH `the franchise taxes, penalties and interest due at the time the certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void` IS 12000, `the annual franchise tax that would be due and payable for the year in which the revival is effected, at the then current rate of taxation` IS 2500, `the date the certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void` IS YearMonthDay 2020 2 29, `the date the revival is effected` IS YearMonthDay 2025 2 28) EQUALS 12000
#ASSERT (`s 312(g) the sum the corporation pays to this State on revival` WITH `the franchise taxes, penalties and interest due at the time the certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void` IS 12000, `the annual franchise tax that would be due and payable for the year in which the revival is effected, at the then current rate of taxation` IS 2500, `the date the certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void` IS YearMonthDay 2020 2 29, `the date the revival is effected` IS YearMonthDay 2025 3 1) EQUALS 7500
-- Revived within a year: the sum due at the time.
#ASSERT (`s 312(g) the sum the corporation pays to this State on revival` WITH `the franchise taxes, penalties and interest due at the time the certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void` IS 800, `the annual franchise tax that would be due and payable for the year in which the revival is effected, at the then current rate of taxation` IS 2500, `the date the certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void` IS YearMonthDay 2025 4 1, `the date the revival is effected` IS YearMonthDay 2025 9 1) EQUALS 800
-- The payment does not reduce the franchise tax due for the year of revival.
#ASSERT (`s 312(g) the franchise tax still due under Chapter 5 for the year in which the revival is effected` WITH `the franchise tax due under Chapter 5 for the year in which the revival is effected` IS 2500, `the payment made pursuant to subsection (g)` IS 7500) EQUALS 2500
-- A certificate of validation under section 204 that relates to a time of forfeiture brings the reports and taxes due at once.
#ASSERT `s 312(g) the annual reports and franchise taxes for the period of forfeiture, with interest, must be filed and paid when the certificate of validation is filed` WITH `a certificate of validation under § 204 is filed` IS TRUE, `the certificate of validation relates to a time during which the corporation’s certificate of incorporation had been forfeited or void` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(g) the annual reports and franchise taxes for the period of forfeiture, with interest, must be filed and paid when the certificate of validation is filed` WITH `a certificate of validation under § 204 is filed` IS TRUE, `the certificate of validation relates to a time during which the corporation’s certificate of incorporation had been forfeited or void` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(g) the annual reports and franchise taxes for the period of forfeiture, with interest, must be filed and paid when the certificate of validation is filed` WITH `a certificate of validation under § 204 is filed` IS FALSE, `the certificate of validation relates to a time during which the corporation’s certificate of incorporation had been forfeited or void` IS TRUE)
-- (h): the board is those who would be directors but for the forfeiture.
#ASSERT `s 312(h) the person is a member of the board of directors or governing body for the purposes of section 312` WITH `the person would be a duly elected or appointed director or member of the governing body but for the certificate of incorporation having become forfeited or void pursuant to this title` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(h) the person is a member of the board of directors or governing body for the purposes of section 312` WITH `the person would be a duly elected or appointed director or member of the governing body but for the certificate of incorporation having become forfeited or void pursuant to this title` IS FALSE)
-- A majority of those then in office suffices, though less than a quorum: 3 of 5 yes, 2 of 5 no, 1 of 1 (the sole director) yes, 2 of 4 no.
#ASSERT (`s 312(h) the requirement for authorization by the board of directors is satisfied` WITH `the number of directors or members of the governing body then in office` IS 5, `the number of them who authorize the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS 3, `the stockholders elected a full board of directors as provided by the bylaws` IS FALSE, `the board so elected authorized the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 312(h) the requirement for authorization by the board of directors is satisfied` WITH `the number of directors or members of the governing body then in office` IS 5, `the number of them who authorize the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS 2, `the stockholders elected a full board of directors as provided by the bylaws` IS FALSE, `the board so elected authorized the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 312(h) the requirement for authorization by the board of directors is satisfied` WITH `the number of directors or members of the governing body then in office` IS 1, `the number of them who authorize the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS 1, `the stockholders elected a full board of directors as provided by the bylaws` IS FALSE, `the board so elected authorized the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 312(h) the requirement for authorization by the board of directors is satisfied` WITH `the number of directors or members of the governing body then in office` IS 4, `the number of them who authorize the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS 2, `the stockholders elected a full board of directors as provided by the bylaws` IS FALSE, `the board so elected authorized the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- No director available: the stockholders elect a full board and that board authorizes.
#ASSERT (`s 312(h) the requirement for authorization by the board of directors is satisfied` WITH `the number of directors or members of the governing body then in office` IS 0, `the number of them who authorize the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS 0, `the stockholders elected a full board of directors as provided by the bylaws` IS TRUE, `the board so elected authorized the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 312(h) the requirement for authorization by the board of directors is satisfied` WITH `the number of directors or members of the governing body then in office` IS 0, `the number of them who authorize the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS 0, `the stockholders elected a full board of directors as provided by the bylaws` IS TRUE, `the board so elected authorized the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 312(h) the requirement for authorization by the board of directors is satisfied` WITH `the number of directors or members of the governing body then in office` IS 0, `the number of them who authorize the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS 0, `the stockholders elected a full board of directors as provided by the bylaws` IS FALSE, `the board so elected authorized the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not covered: more authorizing than are in office.
#ASSERT (`s 312(h) the requirement for authorization by the board of directors is satisfied` WITH `the number of directors or members of the governing body then in office` IS 5, `the number of them who authorize the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS 6, `the stockholders elected a full board of directors as provided by the bylaws` IS FALSE, `the board so elected authorized the revival and the filing of the certificate` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Any officer or stockholder may call the special meeting for the election of directors, on notice under section 222.
#ASSERT `s 312(h) the person may call a special meeting of the stockholders for the purpose of electing directors` WITH `the person calling the meeting` IS `an officer`, `notice is given in accordance with § 222` IS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 312(h) the person may call a special meeting of the stockholders for the purpose of electing directors` WITH `the person calling the meeting` IS `a stockholder`, `notice is given in accordance with § 222` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(h) the person may call a special meeting of the stockholders for the purpose of electing directors` WITH `the person calling the meeting` IS `a director`, `notice is given in accordance with § 222` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(h) the person may call a special meeting of the stockholders for the purpose of electing directors` WITH `the person calling the meeting` IS `another party named in the provision` "a creditor’s agent", `notice is given in accordance with § 222` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(h) the person may call a special meeting of the stockholders for the purpose of electing directors` WITH `the person calling the meeting` IS `an officer`, `notice is given in accordance with § 222` IS FALSE)
-- The bylaws are those that would have been duly adopted but for the forfeiture.
#ASSERT `s 312(h) the instrument is the bylaws of the corporation for the purposes of section 312` WITH `the instrument would be the duly adopted bylaws of the corporation but for the certificate of incorporation having become forfeited or void pursuant to this title` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(h) the instrument is the bylaws of the corporation for the purposes of section 312` WITH `the instrument would be the duly adopted bylaws of the corporation but for the certificate of incorporation having become forfeited or void pursuant to this title` IS FALSE)
-- (i): the forfeiture period counts toward the section 211(c) periods, and the special meeting is deemed an annual meeting, for a stock corporation; (j) takes (i) out for a nonstock corporation.
#ASSERT `s 312(i) the period the certificate was forfeited or void is included within the calculation of the periods to which section 211(c) refers` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`, `the revival of the certificate of incorporation has been effected` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(i) the period the certificate was forfeited or void is included within the calculation of the periods to which section 211(c) refers` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`, `the revival of the certificate of incorporation has been effected` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(i) the period the certificate was forfeited or void is included within the calculation of the periods to which section 211(c) refers` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a charitable nonstock corporation`, `the revival of the certificate of incorporation has been effected` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 312(i) the special meeting of stockholders is deemed an annual meeting of stockholders for the purposes of section 211(c)` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`, `the revival of the certificate of incorporation has been effected` IS TRUE, `the special meeting of stockholders was held in accordance with subsection (h)` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(i) the special meeting of stockholders is deemed an annual meeting of stockholders for the purposes of section 211(c)` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`, `the revival of the certificate of incorporation has been effected` IS TRUE, `the special meeting of stockholders was held in accordance with subsection (h)` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(i) the special meeting of stockholders is deemed an annual meeting of stockholders for the purposes of section 211(c)` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a nonstock corporation with membership interests`, `the revival of the certificate of incorporation has been effected` IS TRUE, `the special meeting of stockholders was held in accordance with subsection (h)` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 312(j) subsection (i) of section 312 applies to the corporation` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 312(j) subsection (i) of section 312 applies to the corporation` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable`)
-- (j): for a nonstock corporation the governing body acts as the board, and the members entitled to vote as the stockholders.
#ASSERT (`s 312(j) the party who performs the act for the corporation` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`, `the party who performs the act for a corporation having capital stock` IS `a director`) EQUALS `a director`
#ASSERT (`s 312(j) the party who performs the act for the corporation` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a nonstock corporation with membership interests`, `the party who performs the act for a corporation having capital stock` IS `a director`) EQUALS `another party named in the provision` "a member of the governing body"
#ASSERT (`s 312(j) the party who performs the act for the corporation` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a charitable nonstock corporation`, `the party who performs the act for a corporation having capital stock` IS `a stockholder`) EQUALS `a member of a nonstock corporation`
#ASSERT (`s 312(j) the party who performs the act for the corporation` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a charitable nonstock corporation`, `the party who performs the act for a corporation having capital stock` IS `an officer`) EQUALS `an officer`

§ `s 313 Revival of certificate of incorporation or charter of exempt corporations`

-- (a): an exempt corporation forfeited under section 136(b) or void under section 510, on satisfactory proof and a certificate of revival under section 312.
--  columns of each call: exempt, forfeited under 136(b), void under 510, proof submitted, certificate of revival filed
