#ASSERT NOT (`s 313(a) the exempt corporation is deemed to have filed all the reports and is relieved of all the taxes and penalties` WITH `the corporation is an exempt corporation within the meaning of § 501(b)` IS TRUE, `the certificate has become forfeited pursuant to § 136(b) for failure to obtain a registered agent` IS FALSE, `the certificate has become inoperative and void by operation of § 510 for failure to file the annual franchise tax reports required and to pay the taxes or penalties from which it would have been exempt if the reports had been filed` IS FALSE, `satisfactory proof of its right to be classified as an exempt corporation has been submitted to the Secretary of State` IS TRUE, `a certificate of revival has been filed with the Secretary of State in manner and form as required by § 312` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 313(a) the exempt corporation is deemed to have filed all the reports and is relieved of all the taxes and penalties` WITH `the corporation is an exempt corporation within the meaning of § 501(b)` IS TRUE, `the certificate has become forfeited pursuant to § 136(b) for failure to obtain a registered agent` IS TRUE, `the certificate has become inoperative and void by operation of § 510 for failure to file the annual franchise tax reports required and to pay the taxes or penalties from which it would have been exempt if the reports had been filed` IS FALSE, `satisfactory proof of its right to be classified as an exempt corporation has been submitted to the Secretary of State` IS FALSE, `a certificate of revival has been filed with the Secretary of State in manner and form as required by § 312` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 313(a) the exempt corporation is deemed to have filed all the reports and is relieved of all the taxes and penalties` WITH `the corporation is an exempt corporation within the meaning of § 501(b)` IS TRUE, `the certificate has become forfeited pursuant to § 136(b) for failure to obtain a registered agent` IS TRUE, `the certificate has become inoperative and void by operation of § 510 for failure to file the annual franchise tax reports required and to pay the taxes or penalties from which it would have been exempt if the reports had been filed` IS FALSE, `satisfactory proof of its right to be classified as an exempt corporation has been submitted to the Secretary of State` IS TRUE, `a certificate of revival has been filed with the Secretary of State in manner and form as required by § 312` IS FALSE)
-- (b): proof, certificate and fees filed and paid: revived as under section 312(e).
#ASSERT `s 313(b) the exempt corporation is revived with the same force and effect as provided in section 312(e)` WITH `the corporation is an exempt corporation within the meaning of § 501(b)` IS TRUE, `the corporation has filed the proof of classification as required by subsection (a)` IS TRUE, `the corporation has filed the certificate of revival` IS TRUE, `the required filing fees have been paid` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 313(b) the exempt corporation is revived with the same force and effect as provided in section 312(e)` WITH `the corporation is an exempt corporation within the meaning of § 501(b)` IS FALSE, `the corporation has filed the proof of classification as required by subsection (a)` IS TRUE, `the corporation has filed the certificate of revival` IS TRUE, `the required filing fees have been paid` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 313(b) the exempt corporation is revived with the same force and effect as provided in section 312(e)` WITH `the corporation is an exempt corporation within the meaning of § 501(b)` IS TRUE, `the corporation has filed the proof of classification as required by subsection (a)` IS FALSE, `the corporation has filed the certificate of revival` IS TRUE, `the required filing fees have been paid` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 313(b) the exempt corporation is revived with the same force and effect as provided in section 312(e)` WITH `the corporation is an exempt corporation within the meaning of § 501(b)` IS TRUE, `the corporation has filed the proof of classification as required by subsection (a)` IS TRUE, `the corporation has filed the certificate of revival` IS FALSE, `the required filing fees have been paid` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 313(b) the exempt corporation is revived with the same force and effect as provided in section 312(e)` WITH `the corporation is an exempt corporation within the meaning of § 501(b)` IS TRUE, `the corporation has filed the proof of classification as required by subsection (a)` IS TRUE, `the corporation has filed the certificate of revival` IS TRUE, `the required filing fees have been paid` IS FALSE)
