#ASSERT NOT (`s 313(c) the exempt corporation must still file the annual report required by section 502` WITH `the corporation is an exempt corporation within the meaning of § 501(b)` IS FALSE)

§ `s 314 Status of corporation`

#ASSERT `s 314 the corporation continues as provided in its certificate, possesses the benefits of this chapter and is subject to its restrictions and liabilities` WITH `the corporation desires to renew, extend and continue its corporate existence` IS TRUE, `the corporation has complied with the applicable constitutional provisions of this State` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 314 the corporation continues as provided in its certificate, possesses the benefits of this chapter and is subject to its restrictions and liabilities` WITH `the corporation desires to renew, extend and continue its corporate existence` IS TRUE, `the corporation has complied with the applicable constitutional provisions of this State` IS FALSE)
